e choosing a city",{"id":"section-1","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Choose a scholarship route before choosing a city"}],[["$","p","The Stipendium Hungaricum programme is managed by the Tempus Public Foundation and is available through agreements with sending partners. Its eligible degrees and study fields depend on the applicant's country. Start with the current sending-partner list, then compare the universities and courses actually offered to that partner.",{"children":"The Stipendium Hungaricum programme is managed by the Tempus Public Foundation and is available through agreements with sending partners. Its eligible degrees and study fields depend on the applicant's country. Start with the current sending-partner list, then compare the universities and courses actually offered to that partner."}],"$L18"],"$L19"]}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d"]]}],"$L1e","$L1f"]}],"$L20"]}]
